      "releaseNotes": "Protego 3.12 is a small update that fixes how pictures open on old Reddit.\n\nFIXES:\n- On old Reddit, an enlarged picture opens in a new tab, and with Redirect to old.reddit.com on, the tab shows only the picture.\n- Clicking a picture on old Reddit no longer opens a tab that shows the post again.\n- Opening a picture in one gallery no longer blanks the other galleries on the page.",
